# 🚀 System Design - Write Conflicts (Version Vectors & CRDTs)

> **Goal:** Multi-Leader Replication mein jab **same data ko multiple leaders ek saath update kar dete hain**, tab conflict ko detect aur resolve kaise karein bina data lose kiye.

---

# 📌 Why do Write Conflicts happen?

Single Leader mein sirf ek database write accept karta tha.

```
Client

↓

Leader

↓

Write
```

Conflict ka chance almost zero.

---

Lekin Multi-Leader mein...

```
        Leader A

         ↑     ↑

       Write   |

              Write

         ↓     ↓

        Leader B
```

Dono leaders independently writes accept kar sakte hain.

Isi wajah se **Write Conflict** hota hai.

---

# 🤔 What is Concurrent Write?

**Concurrent Write** ka matlab hai

> **Do leaders ne same data ko update kiya, lekin dono ko ek dusre ke update ka pata hi nahi tha.**

Ye zaroori nahi ki exact same millisecond pe ho.

Bas replication hone se pehle dono ne independently write kar diya.

---

## Example

Suppose ek Counter hai.

Initially

```
Counter = 0
```

Leader A

```
0

↓

