# 📊 Summary Table

| Method | Strategy | Data Loss | Best Use Case |
|----------|-----------|-----------|---------------|
| Last Write Wins | Latest Timestamp Wins | ❌ Possible | Simple Applications |
| Version Vectors | Track history per node | ✅ No | Detect concurrent writes |
| Store Siblings | Save all conflicting values | ✅ No | Manual/App-level resolution |
| CRDT | Automatic merge | ✅ No | Counters, Sets, Shopping Cart |

