# 📌 Version Vector vs Normal Version Number

| Normal Version | Version Vector |
|----------------|----------------|
| Single Counter | Counter per Leader |
| Cannot detect concurrency | Detects concurrent writes |
| Data Loss Possible | Safe Conflict Detection |
| Simple | More Powerful |

