# 🧠 Memory Trick

```
⚔️ Multi Leader

↓

Concurrent Writes

↓

Conflict

❌ LWW
→ Loses Data

✅ Version Vector
→ Detects Conflict

👨‍👩‍👧 Store Siblings
→ Keep Both

🤖 CRDT
→ Merge Automatically
```

> **🔥 Golden Rule:** **Timestamp sirf "kab" batata hai, Version Vector "kisne kya history dekhi hai" batata hai.** Isi wajah se Version Vectors concurrent writes ko accurately detect kar sakte hain, aur CRDTs un conflicts ko automatically resolve karne ki capability dete hain.